\begin{abstract}
This manuscript presents the full numerical architecture of SASA-v4.0, 
including the warped product manifold 
$\mathcal{N}_{11} = \mathcal{M}_4 \times \mathcal{X}_6 \times S^1$, 
the Oracle-Extended Hilbert Space $\mathcal{H}_{\text{oracle}}$, 
finite-grid discretization of $\mathcal{M}_4$, 
non-local entanglement kernel construction, 
spectral stability bounds, 
and a high-performance CUDA execution engine implementing 
the Cayley time-evolution operator.
\end{abstract}

